OTOGAKURE OPERATIONS — MISSION BRIEF
STATUS: ACTIVE
Op Ref: OP-KO-221 "Serpent's Approach"

Objective
Establish and maintain covert presence within the Hidden Leaf Village ahead of the
sanctioned operation. Gather force disposition, identify high-value bloodline targets,
and prepare fallback caches.

Cover
Operatives insert under Grass and Rain traveling papers via the Chunin Exam pipeline.
Maintain assumed identities at all times. No operative is to reveal affiliation with Oto
or with Lord Orochimaru under any circumstance, including capture.

Standing Tasks
- Map the perimeter watch rotation and the Barrier Team schedule.
- Confirm the Third Hokage's movements and personal guard.
- Flag any candidate vessel presenting a viable kekkei genkai; report by dead-drop only.
- Do not engage. This is reconnaissance. Premature contact jeopardizes the wider plan.

Communications
Reports via serpent courier or dead-drop cipher 7. No direct transmissions inside the
Leaf perimeter. Silence is preferable to a compromised message.

Authorized: Head Medic, on behalf of Lord Orochimaru.
